8,Indo-European languages Facts for Kids,https://kids.kiddle.co/Indo-European_languages,"Today, Indo-European languages are spoken all over the world. They are the main languages in Europe, the Iranian plateau, and South Asia. In the past, they were also important in Anatolia and Central Asia. The earliest writings in an Indo-European language are from the Bronze Age.",Urdu,Indo-European
9,Geographic Spread of the Indo-European... - Geography Realm,https://www.geographyrealm.com/geographic-spread-of-the-indo-european-language-family/,"Understanding the early spread of Indo-European languages was the focus of a study by the Australian Centre for Ancient DNA in partnership with Harvard Medical School, the results of which were recently published in the journal Nature.",Urdu,Indo-European
